  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/tools/activity-data-query/index.html?module_name=constellation&amp;month=202403\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/tools/activity-data-query/index.html?module_name=constellation&amp;month=202403</a></p><p>Dear all，<br />&nbsp;<br />&ldquo;守护白羊座&rdquo;活动已于4月15日下线，现对活动榜单奖励发放。<br />&nbsp;<br />辛苦@叶导 审批；<br />辛苦@灿灿&nbsp;&nbsp;配置；<br />&nbsp;<br />一、榜单资源奖励明细如下：</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 102.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 65.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 81.95pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 65.25pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 63.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 24.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 45.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 45.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 64.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 45.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 30.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 30.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 64.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 35.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 64.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 35.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>超秀卡*1张*5分钟</td><td><br /></td><td>靓号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>白羊座代言人称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>守护白羊座直播间角标</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>白羊流光勋章</td><td>主播，守护白羊座获得，计数型</td><td><br /></td><td>白羊星河勋章</td><td>用户，守护白羊座获得，计数型</td><td><br /></td><td>守护星座发言波纹</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>守护星座上麦动效</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>白羊座公聊角标</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>白羊座公聊皮肤</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>资源id</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>资源id</td><td>更改名称后下发</td><td><br /></td><td>资源id</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>资源id</td><td>2746</td><td><br /></td><td>资源id</td><td>2747</td><td><br /></td><td>资源id</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>资源id</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>下发名单</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>靓号</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td><td><br /></td><td>下发名单</td><td>时长</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>384613713</td><td>*1张*5分钟</td><td>106494527</td><td>待提供</td><td>15</td><td><br /></td><td>384613713</td><td>21</td><td><br /></td><td>384613713</td><td>7</td><td><br /></td><td>384613713</td><td>永久</td><td><br /></td><td>776912516</td><td>永久</td><td><br /></td><td>106494527</td><td>7</td><td><br /></td><td>106494527</td><td>7</td><td><br /></td><td>776912516</td><td>7</td><td><br /></td><td>776912516</td><td>7</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>769473717</td><td>待提供</td><td>15</td><td><br /></td><td>106494527</td><td>21</td><td><br /></td><td>763487003</td><td>5</td><td><br /></td><td>763487003</td><td>永久</td><td><br /></td><td>760919337</td><td>永久</td><td><br /></td><td>769473717</td><td>5</td><td><br /></td><td>769473717</td><td>5</td><td><br /></td><td>760919337</td><td>5</td><td><br /></td><td>760919337</td><td>5</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></t